    "title": "Express desire and intention",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-want-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Express desire and intention",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Use 想 + action for a wish to do something. 要 can name a wanted object or a more definite intention to act; 想要 can name a wanted object. Directness depends on the situation, so a bare 要 is not automatically the most polite request.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我想买衣服。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ xiǎng mǎi yīfu 。",
                "meaning": "I would like to buy clothes.",
                "audio": "7f7bc3fa320fa4002a18ec921cf703ae5f5ba385db51ce7458087825c3047772"
              },
              {
                "text": "我要买两件衣服。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ yào mǎi liǎng jiàn yīfu 。",
                "meaning": "I want to buy two items of clothing.",
                "audio": "592eb34ca9f383b098fb8dd5741a84d90baa5f0e341743100b62b61e93185592"
              },
              {
                "text": "我想要这本书。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ xiǎngyào zhè běn shū 。",
                "meaning": "I would like this book.",
                "audio": "501607f9c4885bd135c4ef03299f2f0454111ee09c76c27442782f2691328d28"
              },
              {
                "text": "我要水。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ yào shuǐ 。",
                "meaning": "I want water.",
                "audio": "a419fc9a2e8bbc7fa435b49f8f285bba2adf915aba2482b9d62a260f0a4c64c2"
              }
            ]
